attach
1-9   saved query           ctrl+k commands
g 1-9 switch view           ?      help
esc   back                  q      quit
r     refresh
R     refetch everything

backlog
space pick or unpick this issue                       ↓/j  down         ctrl+d half page down ...
v     pick every issue in this section                ↑/k  up           ctrl+u half page up
m     move these issues to a sprint or the backlog    pgdn page down    g g    first row
                                                      pgup page up      G      last row

board
enter open                                 ↓/j down               pgdn page down                 ...
m     move this issue to another column    ↑/k up                 pgup page up
b     another board of this project        ←/h previous column    g g  first card in this column
                                           →/l next column        G    last card in this column

comment
a write a comment    ↓/j  down         ctrl+d half page down    1-9   saved query           ctrl+k commands
e edit this one      ↑/k  up           ctrl+u half page up      g 1-9 switch view           ?      help
d delete this one    pgdn page down    g g    oldest            esc   back                  q      quit
                     pgup page up      G      newest            r     refresh
                                       ←/h    pan left          R     refetch everything
                                       →/l    pan right

